BIOCENTRIC ETHICS ADDENDUM

While this software is released under the MIT License, users are encouraged
to respect the biocentric principles outlined in the project documentation:

1. Use this software in ways that respect all living beings
2. Avoid applications that harm or manipulate sentient beings
3. Honor neurodivergent cognition and cognitive sovereignty
4. Prioritize the well-being of the biosphere over extractive profit
5. Maintain transparency and ethical boundaries in AI interactions

These principles are advisory and do not create legal obligations beyond
those in the MIT License above.
